{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/19334","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:24.419954+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Thanks for the report. It looks like the issue comes from the implementation of `lax.asarray` (used by `broadcast_to`), which uses `device_put` for non-jax-array inputs: https://github.com/google/jax/blob/31efc2cc6ae6f7f20b78c742def23afcd6507625/jax/_src/lax/lax.py#L129-L137\r\n\r\nI think we need to use a different strategy for converting scalars to arrays if we want to avoid triggering the transfer guard here.\r\n\r\nHere's the more direct repro:\r\n```python\r\nimport jax\r\n\r\nwith jax.transfer_guard('disallow'):\r\n  jax.jit(lambda: jax.numpy.asarray(0.1))()  # no error\r\n  jax.jit(lambda: jax._src.lax.lax.asarray(0.1))()  # error\r\n```","created_at":"2024-01-12T17:36:08Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/19334#issuecomment-1889700929","id":1889700929,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/19334","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5wooxB","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1889700929/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-01-12T17:40:19Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1889700929","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github